            <div xml:id="d408">

                <pb facs="0601" n="487" xml:id="pg487"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.51/1239: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The High Commissioner in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-03-27T15:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 27,
                                1922—3 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received March 28—10:21
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>33. Urge draft of loan law be sent by cable as Haitian Government willing to put
                    through law at once and my opinion is that it should be put through before
                    election on April 10th.</p>
                <p>Am awaiting answer to my 32 March 23, 2 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
